    "title": "Verizon Family",
    "description": "Help keep your family safe and connected on the go with Verizon Family. With features such as Location Sharing, Parental Controls, Safe Walk with SOS, Crash Detection and Roadside Assistance, all in one app.\r\n\r\nFrom a single app, you can:\r\n- Use content filtering\r\n- Monitor and limit Verizon call and text activity on smartphones\r\n- Limit Verizon data usage on smartphones or connected tablets\r\n- Monitor web and app activity\r\n- Manage screen time\r\n- Pause internet\r\n- Use location sharing , pick-me-up and check-in features\r\n- Get location alerts\r\n- View driving activity \r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s New:\r\n- NEW plan tiers: Verizon Family (FREE for Verizon customers) and Verizon Family Plus ($14.99/month).\r\n- Safe Walk with SOS\r\n- Location map accessible on app home screen.\r\n- Roadside Assistance for Verizon Family Plus (towing, lockout service, fuel delivery, tire changes and jumpstarts)\r\n- Invite members not on your Verizon phone plan to join your Verizon Family account.\r\n\r\nLegal: Verizon postpaid mobile plans include Verizon Family location sharing features at no add\u2019l cost or upgrade to Verizon Family Plus ($14.99/mo until canceled) for location sharing and alerts, parental controls for calls, texts and online activity, driving insights and roadside assistance. Roadside assistance through Signature Motor Club, 4 events/yr. Verizon Family app download req\u2019d; iOS and Android devices only. Service does not monitor calls or texts sent over the internet and does not contact 911 for crash or SOS alerts. Push notifications must be enabled to see when new members join family acct. Some alerts sent via text message. Msg & data rates apply.\r\n\r\nSee full terms and conditions at: https://www.verizon.com/support/verizon-family-legal/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Help keep your family safe and connected on the go with Verizon Family. With features such as Location Sharing, Parental Controls, Safe Walk with SOS, Crash Detection and Roadside Assistance, all in one app.<br><br>From a single app, you can:<br>- Use content filtering<br>- Monitor and limit Verizon call and text activity on smartphones<br>- Limit Verizon data usage on smartphones or connected tablets<br>- Monitor web and app activity<br>- Manage screen time<br>- Pause internet<br>- Use location sharing , pick-me-up and check-in features<br>- Get location alerts<br>- View driving activity <br><br>What\u2019s New:<br>- NEW plan tiers: Verizon Family (FREE for Verizon customers) and Verizon Family Plus ($14.99/month).<br>- Safe Walk with SOS<br>- Location map accessible on app home screen.<br>- Roadside Assistance for Verizon Family Plus (towing, lockout service, fuel delivery, tire changes and jumpstarts)<br>- Invite members not on your Verizon phone plan to join your Verizon Family account.<br><br>Legal: Verizon postpaid mobile plans include Verizon Family location sharing features at no add\u2019l cost or upgrade to Verizon Family Plus ($14.99/mo until canceled) for location sharing and alerts, parental controls for calls, texts and online activity, driving insights and roadside assistance. Roadside assistance through Signature Motor Club, 4 events/yr. Verizon Family app download req\u2019d; iOS and Android devices only. Service does not monitor calls or texts sent over the internet and does not contact 911 for crash or SOS alerts. Push notifications must be enabled to see when new members join family acct. Some alerts sent via text message. Msg &amp; data rates apply.<br><br>See full terms and conditions at: https://www.verizon.com/support/verizon-family-legal/",
